              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Grabbing Ripped as a regular whey</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Wheybolic Ripped looks similar on the shelf but adds 200 mg of caffeine, CLA, capsicum and piperine per two scoops. Drunk after an evening workout or alongside coffee and a pre-workout, that caffeine adds up quickly. If you want plain protein, buy Wheybolic Original, the New Wheybolic.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Assuming Informed Choice meets every rule</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Informed Choice is a respected banned-substance program, but it samples products rather than certifying every batch the way Informed Sport does, and some leagues require NSF Certified for Sport. Check your governing body's rules, then confirm the exact Wheybolic product and flavor in the Informed Choice registry.
              </p>
            </div>
