                  GNC and the Amazon listing say the New Wheybolic is Informed Choice certified and regularly tested for more than 285 banned substances, plus Informed Protein certified. We could not confirm a current entry in the Informed Choice registry because it blocked automated access. Tested athletes should search the registry for the exact product and flavor before buying.
                </p>
