              <summary><h3>Is Wheybolic a whey isolate?</h3></summary>
              <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                  Not purely. GNC describes the new protein as ultra-filtered whey isolate and whey protein, which suggests an isolate-led blend with some other whey. At about 77-82% protein by weight it is dense, close to an isolate. If you are lactose-sensitive, a pure isolate such as Dymatize ISO100 is the safer choice.
                </p>
