                  At the prices we saw, GNC was cheaper. A price tracker showed GNC at $101.99 for the 26-serving tub, about $1.96 per 25 g, against $119.99 on Amazon, about $2.31. GNC also runs frequent buy-one-get-one and member deals that can cut the cost to about $0.98 per 25 g. Prices change often, so check both.
